      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e3f540cd841c9987a2b553e6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "让气氛热烈起来吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7bb9e87946dad3ce683486eafc40134548f6819483be42be87313d1e1c717630",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "60000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5062fc3046c245dba5a47847",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要好好看着哦♪\r\n我会成为最拔群的那个！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c43a0da1a6d40661d054dc9030c77ae0890c8065aa9628ae5482b5efeec230f6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "60001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9de11ad739a191b20cf9df72",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一起成为名流吧，训练员亲♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "54b26a67b5a22259d9fc5daf4fc8285324a140d97b9165c00f7f94293466f7dc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "70000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:06c1fab05070393967ede21c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "和你相遇的那天我就感觉到了♪\r\n你比任何人都温柔且优秀♡\r\n……真的，没骗你哦～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d135496954e67e80212bb6d9139b73916cf4a4f3bf28d310a9559e3fc221d8c1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "70001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d5ccc5bcc763e0cd2a5b2303",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大大的蝴蝶结和轻飘飘的褶边，\r\n都超可爱超喜欢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "bfbb41c6836d025e624b9d1bd28317acb3aab16156abee160feb6c29583ecd48",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "70004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:15e5a7c64eee9baa7b5e0984",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好有闪闪发光的感觉。\r\n蓬松的下摆是很好的得分点♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "9108fa59bbae4fed163d6395a8cb280617e0a8470fba4407de717a47798a8801",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "70008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2b0075d38f782da5b895c514",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "怎么样怎么样？\r\n这种轻飘可爱的感觉！\r\n要说的话也就只有那句了吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "d43f88add55bc58a0afd3de4a7180b78e4e346c25598d652771a6f1e4691d81e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "70009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:42ee632329a9f021cffea3d1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天的穿着很不错！\r\n配色和样式都很完美对吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "247a63e2442824618feeef2cedf7a99a406f4a66d63876ad3737132b0a1aad29",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "70010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3de1545e65f01b21ae5c4ce3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然大家都很可爱，\r\n但是在舞台上还是希望能\r\n只看着我啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1d1ba3b6d808705181aafba026a481e224cc24f78f98ef065ac6daab1af133ef",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "70014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e3e17fdbcca2feb5f2b96c32",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "用了各种各样的装饰！\r\n细节的部分也要仔细看哦~♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "3133c0b9f6ed65be8095218e6f3b1de8d51c4b0ad6769e62d48c91621dea0229",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "70015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:91035d86a24e2147211d9f25",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "闪闪发光的首饰\n果然是必不可少的♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "b24c0a52886c192a69b0eeb3d0cad9b8adb0f0f8ad24a86483bc29904d923317",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "70016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6221e9a7524ed7f87082f86f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "花边层层叠叠的很让人激动呢~！",
      "source_fingerprint": "91150b68c8f8c79e4c64e9eb2da0b8cc7b0311ee8eb0a0524ccfff82b3888def",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "70017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:066053d8ce1b5326d71aedd9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这个也好棒！",
      "source_fingerprint": "71149b9a79fcdd61fc4f3789942f526ae48de5a6662a5b1f61a753e6ad2c91e5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "70018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:92f28b0ef8931ead0c982b12",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "什么都很合适♪对吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "e921994a8320b5a8ac3edd72942c7503cb372ab07438b363525e4d037332e28d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "70019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4a2a855234b23d40e45ee76a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "果然还是最喜欢蓝色了。\n因为和姐姐还有高尚亲同一个颜色呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "499561ed0b2ef9da22636a2cd5aecb1664dd9f995956799b5c0900bb207cc9de",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
